<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{true}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">INPUT / 两个独立模块</view><view class="title">两种选择，一面镜子</view><view class="card accent"><view class="heading">01 长期聆听</view><view>使用接口可见长期 Top100，按播放次数加权。不是注册以来的全部历史。</view></view><view class="card cyan"><view class="heading">02 选定红心 · {{items.length}} / 50 首</view><view class="muted">每首歌曲等权。红心与加入自订歌单、订阅歌单不同。</view><view class="field"><text>歌曲 ID</text><input type="number" value="{{songId}}" placeholder="歌曲分享链接中的数字ID" data-field="songId" bindinput="field" maxlength="24"/></view><view class="grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{likedDate}}" data-field="likedDate" bindchange="field"><button class="secondary">{{likedDate || '红心日期（可选）'}}</button></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{likedTime}}" data-field="likedTime" bindchange="field"><button class="secondary">{{likedTime}} 北京时间</button></picker></view><button class="link" bindtap="unknown">保持时间未知</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="add">添加到输入</button><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="songId" class="row"><view><view>歌曲 {{item.songId}}</view><view class="caption">当前红心时间：{{item.dateLabel}}</view></view><button class="link" bindtap="remove" data-id="{{item.songId}}">移除</button></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="note">{{configured?'你已清空选定红心':'尚未配置选定红心'}}，仍可独立分析长期聆听。</view></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存选择</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="analyze">看看我到底喜欢什么</button><button class="link" bindtap="clear">清空选择</button></view><view class="caption">不知道时间就保持未知；不会按列表位置推断红心顺序。编辑不会改写历史报告。</view></view></view>
